        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Closing Doors is a psychological horror game that has you take control of a father tormented by the guilt of causing the death of his daughter. Every night in your rotting home is a battle, but wait... Was that door always there?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The first stage of grief:</strong> Denial can shield you from reality. Or will it warp it instead?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These walls are changing:</strong> This house. It doesn't make sense anymore. Why does she look like that?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's your fault you know:</strong> Will you ever learn to live with what you've done?</p></li></ul>",
